{#
  BeMart Block/eyecatch — standalone promotional visual block.

  Included as a self-contained partial (no extends). Renders a full-bleed
  hero visual with site copy and primary call-to-action.

  Data contract:
    - src/Resource/Page/Index.php (goTop)
    - var/json_schema/get-index.json
  Links (from #[Link] declarations on Index::onGet):
    goProductList → /products
    goCart        → /cart

  No form. No user-submitted data. Static promotional visual.
  Design language: IdeaStore idea-* vocabulary.
#}
<section class="idea-container idea-commerce-hero idea-commerce-hero--cocoon"
         aria-labelledby="idea-eyecatch-heading">
  <div class="idea-commerce-visual">
    <div class="idea-hero-image-card">
      <img src="/assets/idea-store/images/hero/hero-leaf-d.png"
           alt="日光と葉の影が落ちる静かな部屋に、白磁、木、布の道具が並ぶIDEA STOREの生活シーン"
           loading="eager">
      <div class="idea-commerce-copy">
        <p class="idea-eyebrow">IDEA STORE / イデアストア</p>
        <h2 id="idea-eyecatch-heading" class="idea-title idea-title--commerce">
          <span>暮らしのイデアを、</span><span>見つけよう。</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="idea-lead idea-lead--commerce">
          住まいと、自分時間を心地よく。日常の道具を、ここから選ぶ。
        </p>
        <div class="idea-actions idea-actions--commerce">
          <a class="idea-button idea-button--hero"
             href="/products"
             rel="goProductList">商品を見つける</a>
          <a class="idea-link idea-link--hero"
             href="/cart"
             rel="goCart">カートを見る</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
